00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.790
but grew up really poor.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:25.830
I know everybody says that,

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.370
but government cheese in the refrigerator,

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.720
and you know the whole bit,
