00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:39.853
And as you,

00:02:39.853 --> 00:02:41.710
- How quickly did you
figure that out you think?

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.958
Like what, now when you reconcile that,

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:45.920
it's been interesting
