00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:48.980
I've realized about myself
as I've talked about myself,

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:50.640
done speeches, things of that nature,

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:52.090
attention was the big one.

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:53.880
Like, holy crap, I didn't
run lemonade stands,

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:57.040
I watched cars to watch people, holy crap,

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.810
I wasted the, wasted the first
